              <calculation class='tableau' formula='IF [Parameters].[Fleet Delay Minutes detail (copy)_2224215319865962536] = &apos;MOV Tier&apos;&#13;&#10;THEN (&quot;Tier &quot; + RIGHT(&quot;0&quot;+STR([surge_mov_tier]),2)) &#13;&#10;ELSE RIGHT(&quot;0&quot;+STR(INT([surge_mov_threshold])),2)+&quot;:&quot;+RIGHT(&quot;0&quot;+STR(ROUND([surge_mov_threshold]*60%60)),2)&#13;&#10;END' />
